  "content": "<p>I've again found myself overloaded and trailing behind vibe coders who can make PRs faster than they review and test other people... so i made a thing to make that gap visible</p><p>and because naming things is hard, i called it Workload Walrus</p><p><a href=\"https://cloudisland.nz/tags/opensource\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>opensource</span></a> <a href=\"https://cloudisland.nz/tags/GitWorkflow\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>GitWorkflow</span></a> </p><p><a href=\"https://www.workloadwalrus.com\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://www.</span><span class=\"\">workloadwalrus.com</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a></p>",
  "reblog": null,
  "account": {
